WEBVTT

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.190
How'd your written exam go, Seika?

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.460
It went pretty well, I think.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:16.580
I'm worried I made a bunch 
of mistakes. What do I do?

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.580
Just make up for it during the practicals.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.500
<i>She didn't get a lot of time to prepare.</i>

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.070
<i>She did the best she could, I'm sure.</i>

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.800
She uses a sword?

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:33.920
Amyu. Commoner.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.850
All four elements?

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.390
Let's see how strong she is.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:11.370
<b>The Reincarnation of
the Strongest Exorcist in Another World</b>

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.980
We will now begin the practical exam.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:19.780
Aim for that target and unleash your magic.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:26.120
Starting from the left, the targets are: 
fire, earth, water, wind, light, dark.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.230
You're free to use as many as you like,

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:32.210
but you'll get points for each one
so you should try to hit as many as possible.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:34.920
Now, let's get started.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:38.650
Red burns bright! 
Spirits of flame and sulfur!

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:41.840
Let out a roar and gather 
your anger into a sphere!

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:42.930
Fireball!

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.080
Yellow bursts with power! 
Spirits that raise up the rocks!

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.940
Shatter and turn your 
rage into deadly stones!

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.520
Stone Blast!

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:53.940
Blue bubbles up from below! 
Spirits of cold springs and icy rain,

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.480
freeze and turn your wrath 
into a spear of ice!

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.190
Icicle Spear!

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:03.280
<i>So most of them just chose one element?</i>

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.200
<i>They're not doing great, either.</i>

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.920
I guess it's my turn. I'll be off, Seika.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.580
Okay, good luck.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.880
Flamenought!

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.560
What was that fire?

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.140
Mid-rank magic? She didn't 
use any incantation...

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:33.350
Look at the target!

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.360
S-Sorry!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.940
That target was enchanted 
with fire resistance...

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.820
May I go to the next target?

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.040
S-Sure...

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:45.490
<i>Huh? "Next"?</i>

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.740
Wind Lance!

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.650
No incantation again.

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:58.910
That's mid-rank magic, right?

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:01.280
What are they going to do
about the targets she blew up?

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.580
Quiet! Quiet, everyone!

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.180
We have spare targets!

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.700
I'm done!

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:09.250
Sorry about the targets!

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.850
Thank you!

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.810
Wh-What did you think, Seika?

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:16.840
I ruined the targets, but...

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.880
Yifa, your wind spell was amazing!

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:21.110
Where'd you learn that?

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:26.000
I've been practicing little by little.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.160
I thought it might surprise you.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:30.400
Yeah, it did.

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.910
<i>Watching your apprentice grow
brings a tear to your eye...</i>

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:36.350
I can still only use fire 
and wind magic, but...

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.500
S-Seika, are you crying?

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.660
No, I'm not! I'm not crying!

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.810
Well, next, please.

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:44.360
Oh, that's me.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.310
He has no magical power, right?

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:49.820
What's he going to do?

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.640
Fireball.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.560
Blue flames? What just happened?

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:58.610
I'll now move on to earth.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:01.400
O-Okay.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.480
It's not going out...

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:06.860
<i>That target's made of granite, huh?</i>

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:12.080
Phase of earth and metal, 
spell of Directional Metal.

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.460
Stone... whatever it was.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:19.170
What the heck is that spell?

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.370
Sorry. I broke it.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:22.640
Okay, next is water...

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:24.630
No, wait! Wait!

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.330
What was that spell?

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.050
It was uh... stone.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:28.890
What?

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.880
Um, sorry.

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:32.420
I'll go on to the next one.

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:34.730
<i>It's not like I could explain it anyway.</i>

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:37.030
<i>Those cubes are pyrite.</i>

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:43.900
<i>I added metal ki and earth ki to the granite, 
causing it to crystallize and shatter.</i>

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.240
<i>But I can't tell them that, obviously.</i>

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:54.790
Icicle... whatsits.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.080
Phase of shadow and water.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.550
Spell of Ice Waterfall.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:06.470
<i>Was that a little too much?</i>

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:09.170
Sorry, that's all from me.

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:11.450
You don't want to try the other elements?

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.890
I think I can only do those three.

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:16.170
<i>Wind isn't one of my five elements,</i>

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.410
<i>and I haven't quite figured 
out light and dark yet.</i>

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:20.650
What is it?

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:24.260
Your magic really startled everybody.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:26.060
It felt good to see!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.300
Hey there.

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.990
How'd it go this year?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:36.660
It was a mess. Tons of accidents.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.860
The Lamprogue boy and his servant?

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:42.510
Do you know how much magical power they have?

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:43.170
No.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:47.080
The servant, Yifa, has so little
she should barely be able to use magic.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:50.550
And Seika has zero. No magical power at all.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.040
Impossible...

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:56.000
But nothing could surprise me after today.

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:01.940
Somebody even more powerful than the 
two of them was also there today.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:06.380
Yes, my student, Amyu, right?

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:08.780
There's probably never been a student

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.740
who's destroyed the targets 
for all the elements like she did.}

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:15.680
I think she might be the hero.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:16.740
The hero?

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.790
Like in the old stories?

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:21.240
Yes, the legendary hero who's 
born in the human lands

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.670
when the demon king is going to revive.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:28.660
That would be interesting if so.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.740
Now, let's see if our names are up there.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.020
I'm so nervous.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.380
Please don't abandon me
even if I haven't passed.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:44.610
I won't. I won't, okay?

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.320
I hope I passed.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:49.470
Now, where's my name?

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:50.860
There it is.

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.240
Congratulations, Seika.

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.340
I ranked third...

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.850
I think I got a perfect score on my 
written test, so that's about as good

00:07:57.850 --> 00:07:58.920
as I could expect.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.160
So, who's above me?

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.550
I'm #2?

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:05.920
I did it, Seika!

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.630
Congratulations, Yifa...

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:13.000
<i>I can't believe I lost out to 
Yifa in my practical score.</i>

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.680
<i>It's kind of shocking.</i>

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:16.470
<i>And #1 is...</i>

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.930
<i>Yeah, I thought i'td be her.</i>

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:23.450
Amyu's the girl with red hair who 
could use all four magics, right?

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.860
Amazing!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:29.110
<i>Huh. I might've already found
who I'm looking for.</i>

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:33.260
<i>Several days after the announcement,</i>

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:35.990
<i>an official invitation was sent to 
the inn at which we were staying.</i>

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.920
<i>Yifa and I officially 
enrolled at the academy.</i>

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:46.010
<i>And today's the entrance ceremony...</i>

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:48.250
S-Seika...

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.680
Don't you think this skirt's too short?

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.510
I-I don't think so...

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:56.960
<i>It is.</i>

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.650
We'll be living in the 
dorms from now on, right?

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:04.260
Will I be allowed into the boys' dorm?

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:05.790
I don't think so.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.670
How can I serve you, then?

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.940
Here, you're just a student.

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:13.780
What is it?

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.940
Are there elementals around here?

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:19.660
Um... Huh? That's a dark elemental.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.900
Wait, why are there so many?

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:23.540
Seika?

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.980
It's probably because of this, I'd guess.

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:35.880
This magic circle has a 
really bad feeling to it.

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:38.010
I agree completely.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.270
What will you do?

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:43.160
It belongs to the school,
so I don't think we can mess with it.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.340
For now, let's head to the ceremony.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.270
Okay.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:50.190
<i>But given the flow of power 
from it, I'd guess that...</i>

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:58.160
The hall's huge!

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.410
And there's so much food!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:03.400
Seika, you're eating already?

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:06.370
You should eat while you can, too, Yifa.

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:08.960
Okay, I'll get some food, too.

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:16.300
Amyu's giving a speech, right?

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:19.590
I'm Amyu, the representative 
for the new students.

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:24.270
I don't know what all your
reasons are for coming here,

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:28.520
but I'm here for one reason 
alone: to get stronger.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:31.360
The strength I seek is the strength...

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.440
<i>There it is. It's close.</i>

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:37.440
to defeat monsters 
and protect my comrades.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.860
<i>It's nearly here.</i>

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:40.740
What?

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:41.820
The door!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.160
What happened?

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.790
No way. Are those...

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.880
lesser demons?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.920
Run!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.710
S-Seika, d-demons!

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.050
<i>They're looking for something.</i>

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.420
Fireball!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.420
Icicle Spear!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:58.570
Wind Lance!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.000
Fireball! Fireball!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.000
Wind Lance!
Fireball!

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:00.400
<i>What a massive waste of time.</i>

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:01.260
Icicle Spear!
Rock Burst!

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.260
<i>What are they doing?</i>

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:02.990
Flamenought!

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:07.890
<i>See what happens when you waste time?</i>

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.400
Wind Lance!

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:24.570
If you can't fight, then get out of the way!

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:27.040
<i>Something's wrong with those monsters.</i>

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.060
<i>Their attacks are slow.</i>

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:31.870
<i>Are they a decoy? Recon?</i>

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.460
<i>No, it doesn't matter.</i>

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:40.130
<i>Found you. There's the caster.</i>

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:45.190
Yifa, if you think it's dangerous, 
use your magic and run.

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:46.020
Got it?

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.400
Why? What about you, Seika?

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.300
I've got a job to do.

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:52.980
A "job"?

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.570
Seika?

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:08.050
Keshikimade tsukiutsukushiki noniawaba

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:12.120
sugashikaramashi hitonarazutomo...

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:17.880
"On a night when the moon is almost 
hauntingly beautiful, I meet someone.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:22.670
Even if that person is a monster, 
not a man, for some reason, I feel fine."

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:27.520
That poem describes exactly 
how I feel right now.

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:35.400
My master was the author 
of that poem, you see.

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:38.420
They were, in their final years, 
rather unstable.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:41.960
And the "monster" it speaks of 
refers, in a small way, to them, too.

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.960
I think it was their way of saying 
that even without a human heart,

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:48.950
there was still something inside them 
that saw the beauty in the moon.

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:54.740
Do you have a heart in you that can 
see how pretty the moons are? Well?

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.170
What's a human child doing here?

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:00.300
Don't tell me you tracked me here.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.600
If so, you're a fool.

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:05.280
You can't defeat me alone.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.180
I was in the mood to play.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:08.760
I was afraid I'm getting out of shape.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.830
So you're in a rush for glory, then?

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:14.060
Foolish, short-lived human.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.600
Come, my servants!

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:17.980
Go!

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.440
Phase of sunlight.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.780
Spell of Falling Fruit.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:29.490
Protective Spell. 
Summoning, phase change, seal.

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:35.910
I'll take this one. 
You can keep the rest.

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.840
You use teleportation magic?

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:42.920
Not bad. I'll face you myself, then!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.480
My name is Gull Galeos.

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:51.560
A demon of metal, 
who controls fire and earth.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:52.630
Phase of sunlight.

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:53.890
Spell of Falling Fruit.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.730
You're wasting your time. 
It won't work on me.

00:13:56.990 --> 00:14:00.020
<i>He can see my invisible hitogata?</i>

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:07.030
Okay, how about this, then?

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:12.720
Is that all?

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:15.450
Then, die!

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:18.160
<i>Huh? That was slow.</i>

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.460
Fool.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:26.180
<i>He teleported the blade 
and changed its course?</i>

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:28.950
I'm a devil.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:33.600
Of course I can use dark teleportation magic!

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.230
You were arrogant.

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:49.740
So, tell me.

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.940
What are you looking for?

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:57.790
You were watching through the eyes of those 
lesser demons the whole time, weren't you?

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:00.700
You could tell, huh?

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.050
Very well.

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:06.200
I'll tell you as thanks for showing me
that strange teleportation magic.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:09.470
There's only one thing 
here that interests me.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.470
The hero!

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.350
The hero? From the fairy tales?

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:15.820
Fairy tales?

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.380
How ironic!

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:25.200
You think that legendary 
battle was just a fairy tale?

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:29.530
Even if the war was many years ago, 
it's hard to believe you've fallen so far!

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:33.950
But the hero and the demon king are 
just delusions you people have, right?

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:38.720
The prophecy 12 years ago was true!

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:41.870
I found her tonight!

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:47.550
A girl with red hair, and inhuman power!

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:50.050
You mean Amyu?

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.370
Her name's "Amyu"?

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.800
That will make it easier to find her.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.140
Let me thank you!

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:02.980
It's over!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:13.570
I never thought I could have such a 
splendid battle with a human child.

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:18.550
No, there's still one more 
thing to deal with. The hero.

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:24.090
Kumorinaki yowa no sorakoso sabishikere

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:28.520
Noroishi kuroki kumo no kenureba...

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:32.380
This was the poem I read 
to my master in response.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:36.470
"A cloudless night sky 
seems lacking, somehow.

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.860
Maybe I hated you, because you were 
like clouds covering the moon,

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:42.980
but now that you're gone, that's how I feel."

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:46.400
Poems aren't really my thing. 
Do you think it's any good?

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:50.630
I killed my master, so I never 
got to hear what they thought.

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:53.840
Oh, the "monster" in the poem was me.

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:56.030
How are you alive?

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:58.800
Why? Can't you tell—

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:03.790
And I'm back to life.

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:08.460
Maybe you can come back to life, 
but why did my blade disappear?

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:12.170
I simply set a spell to eliminate 
anything that didn't belong.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:16.630
Very well. Then I'll just kill you
until you're truly dead!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.140
And the hero, too!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.810
I'll deal with her before 
she becomes the strongest!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:24.730
The strongest... What a waste of time.

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:28.800
Is it the strong who control the world?

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:32.390
The ones most skilled in 
martial arts? No. It's not.

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:34.240
Power means numbers.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.910
And strength means having the 
cunning to control those numbers.

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:42.040
The amount of violence one person can inflict 
is nothing compared to the whole world.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:46.000
You only say that because
you don't know true strength.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:50.000
All kneel in the face of true power!

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:53.380
I did use to be the strongest, actually.

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:55.510
Lies!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:58.630
Phase of water!

00:17:58.630 --> 00:17:59.880
Spell of Waterfall!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.680
How does he have so much magical power?!

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.820
Yup. He used his teleport to escape.

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:16.650
Summoning: Lightning Beast.

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:27.300
You took a direct hit 
while soaked to the bone.

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:28.570
Is that all?

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:32.250
<i>Behind me?</i>

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:36.880
Once again, you were arrogant.

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:39.680
Gotcha.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:46.280
Phase of metal and water.

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:47.600
Spell of Ashen Flowers.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:53.410
Did you know that, Mr. Metal Devil?

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:57.810
Splitting salt into two and one 
will have the ki of metal.

00:18:57.810 --> 00:19:00.920
Which means that salt contains metal.

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:04.370
And crystals of it react violently with water.

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.270
Like they just did.

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:07.750
Impossible.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:09.750
I've never heard of such a metal!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:13.170
Listen, you ever think that 
you should study more?

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:16.160
You ever wonder about what fire really is?

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:18.720
Or why you can decompose 
water to create wind?

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:22.430
Or why cooling wind creates water 
that's colder than normal water?

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.370
Study more.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:25.850
You would lecture me?!

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:29.290
I can still fight!

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:33.000
I can win this...

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:37.030
Those strange charms of yours... 
you have to be running low on them!

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.190
Charms?

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.150
You mean these?

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:42.320
I've got plenty.

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:45.410
I've been making them every day for years.

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:50.210
Now, as much as I hate to bring an end 
to this party, I'm afraid we're done.

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:57.130
I'm going to end today's banquet by 
feeding your body to my servants.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:03.480
<i>On chatorudashu dashu torininavu 
navu ekamu eruviati sakaru sowaka.</i>

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:08.530
Summoning: Mizuchi.

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.860
Wh-What is that thing?

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:24.610
Even the demon king couldn't...

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:27.000
summon a dragon...

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:29.490
It's not a "dragon."

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.750
Call it a "Ryuu".

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:54.020
Now, time to return Mizuchi back 
to where it came from and...

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:59.110
He's trying to run away!

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:00.280
Damn it!

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:02.200
Get back here!

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:26.170
I never thought a servant as weak as 
Mizuchi would try to rebel against me.

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:28.650
I can understand why, though.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:30.510
While its spiritual power may flow well,

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:33.230
my body's not as mature 
as it was in my previous life.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:36.830
Seika!

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:41.420
Sorry, Yuki. Did you get left 
behind during the teleport?

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:45.740
No, I was hiding because
I didn't think I could help.

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:51.600
Are you sure you wanted to use valuable 
sacrifice hitogata on somebody so weak?

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:55.750
I was planning on dying three or four times 
just to make sure they worked.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:57.540
I see.

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:02.250
Oh, and I didn't know you were a poet!

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.590
That's wonderful!

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:05.880
Please don't say that...

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:14.910
Seika...

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:17.780
Where were you?

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:20.380
Sorry, sorry. You okay?

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:23.690
Yes. All the lesser demons were defeated.

00:22:35.100 --> 00:22:39.250
Amyu defeated them all on her own.

00:22:39.520 --> 00:22:41.820
<i>No matter how strong you are,</i>

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:45.570
<i>in the end, the people around you 
will drag you down and crush you.</i>

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:48.910
<i>I learned that the hard way in my last life.</i>

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:54.820
<i>That's why I needed somebody to 
become the strongest instead of me.</i>

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:57.030
<i>Just like how all those useless bureaucrats</i>

00:22:57.030 --> 00:22:59.600
<i>in my last life got to act all 
high and mighty at the Imperial court.</i>

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:03.580
<i>Serving under the strongest person 
must be the smartest way to live.</i>

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:08.710
<i>Yifa's not strong enough, 
but the hero sure is.</i>

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:13.370
<i>I'll be her friend. Somebody she can trust.</i>

00:23:13.760 --> 00:23:16.950
<i>Maybe she'll be crushed in the end.</i>

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:19.540
<i>And maybe I'll be sad, but that's all.</i>

00:23:19.930 --> 00:23:23.020
<i>This time, I'll be happy.</i>

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:26.470
<i>The demons might come back.</i>

00:23:26.470 --> 00:23:29.380
<i>But don't worry, Amyu.</i>

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:32.300
<i>I'll make you the strongest,</i>

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:35.920
<i>even if I have to beat 
this "demon king" myself.</i>

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:40.020
Episode 3:
The Hero the Oracles Spoke Of
